
== 1 — a clock with no listener asks for nothing ==
pending: false

== 2 — one listener asks once, and is told once per frame ==
pending after joining: true
ticks: 3
frames: #1 token 7, #2 token 7, #3 token 7
still pending: true

== 3 — a second listener shares the same frame ==
the first heard 1 more, the second 1

== 4 — the token is each listener's own ==
the first listener's frames carry its own token: true

== 4b — two different things can each want the same frame ==
the clock's listeners heard 2, the other caller 1

== 5 — when the last listener leaves, nothing is asked for ==
pending with one left: true
pending with none: false
listeners: 0
ticks after everyone left: 0
